 with his blindness i can like no no  this is fine but  he won't in that moment right before she  dies  you know with that second go but again  i'm still not sure it needed the second  time around  but you know what overall nitpicks aside  i love this episode  oxygen's great and i love it even more  the second viewing like  realizing how well thought out the  theming of capitalism is  in this one especially given that it's  picking up on stuff that was done  earlier this  season this series because like thin ice  was dealing with some similar topics if  not coming out them from the same angle  so  similar themes new angle new product  love it  doctor who oxygen you rewatched it  lately what do you think about it  whatever your thoughts are drop  something down in the comments let's  talk about it usual stuff to do  like share subscribe i have a patreon  and that is how i pay the bills and keep  this entire thing up  and running it is how i afford to  breathe these breaths which i use  to speak to you but at the end of the  day you do not  have to help me out in these ways i  would greatly appreciate it i encourage  it but  i'm not your boss you're the council  maybe a union of sorts i'm just running  the meetings  and until next time this council is  adjourned  [Music]  hello  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  um  bye
 

